Subject: [candidate] hold object identity through lookup and synchronize FREE

Applies after 0009 and 0012. The retired 0010 must not be applied.
A same-access temporary handle retains the actual object across concurrent
handle close/reuse. The map lock covers lookup/type validation through checked
reference acquisition and participates in FREE using map -> ref lock order.
Every mapper recursion and private handle unwinds before propagation.
Uncertain backend release poisons future operations and reports its real status;
zero/negative dereference does not decrement, and FREE rejects positive refs.
No new server protocol, access path, token retrieval or identity changes.
Not selected by engine recipes. Host race checks do not prove native parity.

